        "content": "<p>dishmaker edited <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14094\">PR #14094</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>This reduces run-time of <code>cranelift-codegen (build-script) (run)</code>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>-0.4%</code> on <code>debug</code></li>\n<li><code>-3.1%</code> on <code>release</code> [^1]</li>\n</ul>\n<p>by changing:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>lines: Vec&lt;String&gt;</code> to</li>\n<li><code>lines: String</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p>so that</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Rust\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">file</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">write_all</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">self</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">lines</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">as_bytes</span><span class=\"p\">())</span><span class=\"o\">?</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>is called once.</p>\n<p>Depends on #14092</p>\n<p>[^1]: build script won't be in opt-<code>release</code> mode, because of <code>[profile.release.build-override]</code> <code>opt-level = 0</code><br>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/blob/a48196189a5e3b5e5f288f776062fb6e7189e43f/Cargo.toml#L177-L178\">https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/blob/a48196189a5e3b5e5f288f776062fb6e7189e43f/Cargo.toml#L177-L178</a></p>\n</blockquote>",
